319	// newest first, plus a form to add one. Server data is read with useQuery under the ['notes'] key
320	// and filtered to this project (never copied into state, never hand-maintained — rule 5). Adding is a
321	// useMutation that invalidates ['notes'], so the list refetches itself with the new note on top. The
322	// only useState here is the text the user is currently typing (rule 4).
